\title{dhis2API: Download Aggregate Data and Metadata from a 'DHIS2' Server}
\description{
\if{html}{\figure{logo.png}{options: style='float: right' alt='logo' width='120'}}

An R client for the Web API of 'DHIS2' (District Health Information Software 2). Reads metadata, aggregate data and tracker records using a username and password or a personal access token. Supports metadata filters, local metadata caching, monthly and weekly period identifiers, and downloads split into smaller requests. Stores aggregate data in a local 'DuckDB' database, resumes interrupted downloads and updates raw data values from changes on the server.
